    web_render_space_hang_before_moving_empty_inline_2026-11-27, 0, "Chrome 159, text-align:right 400px div: '<span class=b></span> <span style=margin-left:5px></span>' puts the box at 295 (the space hangs, the 5px margin counts); Simple 291. With border-left:1px instead: Chrome 299, Simple 295. The hang is reset for an empty inline that moves the pen (empty_inline_box and not empty_plain_inline, layout_engine.spl ~5144)."

